{"sections":[{"slug":"子对象分类子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"子对象分类子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">子对象分类子</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"子对象分类子"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">子对象分类子是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"$(-1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分类空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类空间</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">子对象分类子</span> $\\Omega$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中一个特殊的对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">任意对象到</span> $\\Omega$ <span lang=\"zh\">的态射一一对应于其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/子对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">子对象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">真值</span></h2>\n<p>$\\Omega$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的幂集</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">逻辑公式</span> $\\varphi$ <span lang=\"zh\">的真值为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的子集</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span> $\\Omega$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">在经典逻辑中当然</span> $\\Omega=\\{\\text{false},\\text{true}\\}$. <span lang=\"zh\">而在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/直觉主义逻辑","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直觉主义逻辑</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, $\\Omega$ <span lang=\"zh\">不一定只有两个元素</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">子对象分类子是终层</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的幂对象</span>\n$$\r\n\\Omega\\colon\\quad U\\subset X\\text{ open} \\quad \\mapsto \\quad \\{V\\subset U\\text{ open}\\}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">此时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">逻辑公式</span> $\\varphi$ <span lang=\"zh\">的真值是</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">中最大的使得</span> $U\\models\\varphi$ <span lang=\"zh\">的开集</span> $U$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对象分类子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对象分类子</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}